{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WGaoudurbcLtXgrPWmhp3A","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_7/projects/gen-depth-contamination/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# gen-depth-contamination — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-19 09:14 UTC | 更新原因: 修正 Pythia AUC: 0.5765 → 0.5983 (registry 实际值)\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\n首次系统测量递归合成文本的 generational discrimination boundary K*，发现 K* 是 low-bounded 且 domain-governed（domain ceiling + model competence 框架, D076）。4 domains, 5+ architecture families, retrain-chain K*=7 vs prompt-chain K*=2。详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前进展\\\\n- **阶段**: Code domain cross-model 验证 3/5 完成，LLaMA K*=2 confirmed (D080)\\\\n- **Framing**: Plan C \\\\\\\"domain ceiling + model competence\\\\\\\" 已入稿。Domain hierarchy: Wiki=1, C4=Code=2, arXiv=3\\\\n- **论文状态**: 28 页，正文 ≤ 8 页，0 undefined citations，0 em-dash\\\\n- **实验**: 57 success / 10 negative / 10 failures / 77+ total\\\\n- **关键突破**: LLaMA Code K*=2 跨家族验证 (D080), Cross-scorer Code K*=2 (D079), Retrain K*=7 双家族 (D077/D078)\\\\n- **Dream simulation**: dream_20260519T090934 running (full review mode)\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中实验\\\\n\\\\n| 实验 | GPU | 预计完成 |\\\\n|------|-----|---------|\\\\n| exp_code_mistral7b | cqa1 cuda:3 | ~May 19 11:00 UTC |\\\\n| exp_code_qwen7b | cqa1 cuda:1 | ~May 19 18:00 UTC |\\\\n| exp_32b_c4 | westd cuda:1 | ~May 20-21 |\\\\n\\\\n## Code Domain 结果追踪\\\\n\\\\n| 模型 | K* | 1v2 AUC | 状态 |\\\\n|------|-----|---------|------|\\\\n| Qwen-1.5B | 2 | 0.7382 | ✅ Done + cross-scorer validated (D079) |\\\\n| LLaMA-8B | 2 | 0.7394 | ✅ Done, cross-family confirmed (D080) |\\\\n| Pythia-1.4B | 1 | 0.5983 | ✅ Done (competence-limited) |\\\\n| Mistral-7B | ? | — | RUNNING |\\\\n| Qwen-7B | ? | — | RUNNING |\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [x] LLaMA Code K*=2 confirmed (D080)\\\\n- [x] Cross-scorer validation K*=2 (D079)\\\\n- [x] Retrain K*=7 双家族 (D077/D078)\\\\n- [x] Plan C framing adopted (D076)\\\\n- [x] R8-M1 Eq.1 CI 定义修复\\\\n- [x] 页数压缩 ≤ 8 页\\\\n- [x] LLaMA Code 入稿 (Paper Agent)\\\\n- [ ] exp_code_mistral7b 完成 → 入稿\\\\n- [ ] exp_code_qwen7b 完成 → 入稿\\\\n- [ ] Dream simulation 结果处理\\\\n- [ ] 最终 framing 定稿（Code 5/5 后）\\\\n- [ ] Round 11 内审\\\\n- [ ] exp_32b_c4 结果 bonus patch\\\\n- [ ] Final submission (DDL May 25)\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n- **cqa1**: 2×4090D — cuda:1 qwen7b-code, cuda:3 mistral-code（cuda:0 已归还, cuda:2 已归还）\\\\n- **westd**: cuda:1 exp_32b_c4\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D080 | 2026-05-19 | LLaMA-8B Code K*=2 confirmed (Scenario A): Code ce | exp_code_llama8b, exp_code_qwen1b5, exp_code_qwen1b5_pythia_scorer |\\\\n| D079 | 2026-05-19 | Code cross-scorer validation: Pythia scorer 下 Qwen | exp_code_qwen1b5_pythia_scorer, exp_code_qwen1b5 |\\\\n| D078 | 2026-05-19 | Pythia retrain-chain K*=7 确认，与 Qwen K*=7 完全一致，LoRA | exp_pythia_retrain_depth7, exp_qwen_retrain_depth7 |\\\\n| D077 | 2026-05-19 | Retrain-chain K*=7 confirmed (Qwen-1.5B LoRA)，升级 f | exp_qwen_retrain_chain, exp_qwen_retrain_depth7, exp_008_retrain_chain_v2 |\\\\n| D076 | 2026-05-19 | 采纳 Plan C \\\\\\\"domain ceiling + model competence\\\\\\\" fram | exp_code_pythia1b4, exp_code_qwen1b5, exp_019_mistral7b_depth |\\\\n| D075 | 2026-05-19 | Code domain Pythia K*=1 (vs Qwen K*=2): 暂不改 framin | exp_code_pythia1b4, exp_code_qwen1b5, exp_code_llama8b, exp_code_mistral7b |\\\\n| D074 | 2026-05-18 | Code domain K*=2 确认，4 域矩阵完整（arXiv=3, C4=2, Code=2, | exp_code_qwen1b5, exp_qwen_retrain_chain, exp_code_llama8b |\\\\n| D073 | 2026-05-18 | 放弃 OLMo retrain-chain（两次下载失败），cuda:0 重新分配为 code do | exp_olmo_retrain_v2, exp_code_qwen1b5, exp_code_llama8b |\\\\n| D072 | 2026-05-18 | 启动 code domain K* 测量实验，目标冲 4.0：从 3 域扩展到 4 域堵住审稿人最大 | exp_024_arxiv_depth_chain, exp_023_domain_ablation |\\\\n| D071 | 2026-05-18 | Round 10 (fresh) 3.5: 3 critical + 7 should-fix。θ  | exp_022_cross_scorer_matrix, exp_013_cross_transfer |\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 3414, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01EQYdjJR7AegLfmYPuZnseS","session_id":"4ae90b1b-19b4-4021-a8d9-15784d0863dc","uuid":"cfc12aa1-16d1-4690-b00e-7f5f3d4d3f67","timestamp":"2026-05-19T10:11:33.562Z"}
